$$
\sum_{i=1}^{6} \sum_{j=1}^{7} x_{ij} \geq 30
$$

4. **Non-negativity and Integrality:**
$$
x_{ij} \geq 0,\quad x_{ij} \in \mathbb{Z} \qquad \forall i, j
$$

